<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9c4fe0d8">The entry criteria for each test phase will be defined in the test strategy. Each entry criteria item will be validated
against the actual data or testing result. &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The following are entry criteria items to evaluate:&lt;br /&gt;
• The test environment is configured and running&lt;br /&gt;
• All requirements are approved and signed off on by the business team&lt;br /&gt;
• All test cases are reviewed and approved by the business and test team&lt;br /&gt;
• All the testing team resources (testers, machines, software, configurations, etc.) are available as outlined by the
sprint ‘n’ test plan or test approach</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="bee71b0d"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="f62c7c49"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="ad86daff"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="65c42374">To serve as the final checkpoint before the test execution activities can be performed and validate that the entry criteria
defined in the test strategy are met.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="f933cc72"></attribute>
</Element>
